References: <ajJ5jhBiHIU.sCgrcHtvDAAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/bioc-ggtree/c/ajJ5jhBiHIU/m/UxnYBdoNBAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Yes the parameter was removed as we can directly round the variable.

ggtree(mytree, aes(color=branch.length), ndigits=2) + geom_text(aes(x=branch, label=round(as.numeric(posterior), 2), size=2)

